  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>-Parking for 3 Vehicles (Jeep is not available for guest use.)<br>-Propane Gas Grill<br>-Exterior Shower<br>-Outside Balcony with Gulf Views<br>-Steps away from the beloved Red Bar<br>-Steps to the Beach<br><br>DETAILS:<br>Grayton Beach has been named one of the top 10 most beautiful beaches in the world by Travel and Leisure and Conde Nast. Your slice of heaven awaits you at the spacious beach house called Sea Forever in the heart of Grayton Beach!<br><br>262 Garfield Street is a brightly decorated beach home featuring five bedrooms and four and a half bathrooms. A family reunion or relaxing couples' getaway can successfully accommodate you in this home that sleeps 14 very comfortably. Three bedrooms have king size beds and private bathrooms. Two children's rooms with a “Jack and Jill” bathroom. Two sets of bunk beds, a full, and twin bed offer plenty of fun in two separate rooms for the kids. A large, well stocked kitchen, table to seat the whole gang, a spacious living room with TV/DVD player and stereo, and plenty of board games will keep everyone entertained on the fabulous top floor.<br><br>Two large front porches with a wonderful gulf breeze and view are perfect for playing cards, al fresco dining or watching all the happenings at downtown Grayton. Grab a hammock chair and finish that book you have been wanting to read.<br><br>The house is furnished with all hardwood flooring, eclectic art from local artists, different lighting, and wonderful fabrics and colors. From the front door, you are only 37 steps away from the sand!<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>-Guest Bedroom: Two Twin Over Twin Bunk Beds (4), Shared Bathroom with Walk In Shower<br>-Guest Bedroom: One Twin Bed (1), One Full Bed (2), Shared Bathroom with Walk In Shower<br>-Guest Bedroom: King Bed (2), Private Bathroom with Shower/ Tub Combo<br>-Guest Bedroom: King Bed (2), One Twin Day Bed (1), Private Bathroom with Shower/ Tub Combo<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>-Master Bedroom: King Bed (2), Private Bathroom with Walk In Shower and Soaking Tub<br>-Half Bathroom <br>-Laundry Area<br>-Kitchen<br>-Main Living Area",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Limited Time March Savings | Parking for 3, Gulf views, Steps to Red Bar, and the Beach!"
        }
      ],
